## Conventions

- Services layer for business logic — views call services, never ORM directly
- Mass-assignment guard: always use `fields = [...]` on ModelForm / Serializer; never `fields = "__all__"`
- `SECRET_KEY`, `DATABASE_URL` from env — never committed
- `DEBUG = False` in prod; `ALLOWED_HOSTS` set explicitly
- `SECURE_*` headers (HSTS, SSL redirect, CSRF cookie) enabled in prod
- ORM: `select_related`/`prefetch_related` to avoid N+1; audit with `django-debug-toolbar` in dev
- Signals used sparingly — prefer explicit service calls for auditability
- Migrations reviewed in PRs; never `--fake` in shared environments

